<title>SPAIN: Corp Mapfre first half profit falls.</title>
<headline>Corp Mapfre first half profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end June (billion</p>
<p>pesetas, unless stated)</p>
<p> Pretax profit			    9.76     vs    13.28</p>
<p> Net taxed profit			 6.94     vs     8.92</p>
<p> Net attrib profit			5.40     vs     7.02</p>
<p> Ordinary profit			  7.29     vs     6.91</p>
<p> Extraordinary profit		   2.48     vs     6.37</p>
<p>NOTE - Corporacion Mapfre is the listed holding company of Mapfre Mutualidad, Spain's biggest insurance group.  </p>
<p>Premium income split as follows:</p>
<p> Mapfre Vida			     46.24     vs    42.48</p>
<p> Mapfre Seguros Generales	    34.82     vs    31.87</p>
<p> Mapfre Re				 33.16     vs    29.02</p>
<p> Mapfre International		  46.90     vs    39.10</p>
<p> Mapfre Caucion y Credito	     3.15     vs     2.39</p>
<p> Mapfre Asistencia			6.22     vs     4.75</p>
</text>
